### Variables — set these before running
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = Bearer local-dev-secret
@user_id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Health — liveness
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Health — readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Create notification
POST {{base}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "event_type": "order.shipped",
  "title": "Your order has shipped",
  "body": "Order #1234 is on its way.",
  "metadata": { "order_id": "1234", "carrier": "DHL" }
}

### List all notifications
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: {{token}}

### List notifications for one user
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications?user_id={{user_id}}&limit=10
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get single notification — replace ID with one returned above
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get user preferences
GET {{base}}/api/v1/preferences
Authorization: {{token}}

### Upsert user preferences
PUT {{base}}/api/v1/preferences
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "webhook_url": "http://localhost:9001/hook",
  "channels": ["email", "in_app"]
}

### WebSocket connection (use wscat or similar)
### wscat -c ws://localhost:8080/ws
